Package: AMRfinder
Version: 0.0.4
Date: 2026-06-17
Title: Associated Methylation Region finder
Author: Xiaoqing Pan, Juanjie Wu, Yifan Yang <yfyang.86@hotmail.com>
Maintainer: Yifan Yang <yfyang.86@hotmail.com>
Description: AMRfinder (Associated Methylation Region finder) is a novel algorithm specifically designed to identify phenotype-associated methylation regions (especially for RRBS data). AMRfinder integrates circular binary segmentation with linear or linear mixed model-based scoring to dynamically detect methylated blocks associated with continuous phenotype while adjusting for sample-level covariates. 
License: Apache License 2.0
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/CORRS-LAB/AMRfinder
BugReports: https://github.com/CORRS-LAB/AMRfinder/issues
